$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectintbc  LOC_AFTER=?

* Borel-Caratheodory on a rectangle: a function holomorphic on an open set containing the rectangle, vanishing at a strictly interior point and with real part bounded above, has a modulus bound at a second strictly interior point.

